WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back and bring the soles of the feet together.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Let the knees fall open wide.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Arms rest by the sides or on the belly.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Soften the jaw and forehead.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Draw the knees together to exit.
